          "en": "into the meetups prop like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.3,
          "end": 37.2,
          "en": "but instead let's change this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 37.2,
          "end": 39.75,
          "en": "to behave the way it would behave",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.75,
          "end": 42.71,
          "en": "if we would reach out to a backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42.71,
          "end": 45.52,
          "en": "And how would we typically do this in React?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 45.52,
          "end": 48.4,
          "en": "Well, if we wanna send a HTTP request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.4,
          "end": 50.25,
          "en": "once this page is rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.25,
          "end": 54.11,
          "en": "we would typically use the useEffect hook to control this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.11,
          "end": 55.73,
          "en": "So we would import useEffect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.73,
          "end": 59.84,
          "en": "from React and then execute useEffect here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 60.87,
          "end": 63.87,
          "en": "and have an empty dependencies array, probably,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 63.87,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "which means that this affect function runs whenever",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 70.44,
          "en": "the component is first rendered, but never thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.44,
          "end": 73.28,
          "en": "And then in here we could fetch our data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 73.28,
          "end": 75.77,
          "en": "and we could manage some state for this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 75.77,
          "end": 77.924,
          "en": "with the useState hook, which we therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 77.924,
          "end": 81.12,
          "en": "also need to import from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 81.12,
          "end": 84.9,
          "en": "And then here, we could manage our list of meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 84.9,
          "end": 88.65,
          "en": "Let's say the loadedMeetups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.65,
          "end": 93.4,
          "en": "and we have our setLoadedMeetups state updating function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.4,
          "end": 94.75999999999999,
          "en": "and in useEffect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.75999999999999,
          "end": 99.75999999999999,
          "en": "we would send that HTTP request and fetch data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.99000000000001,
          "end": 101.92,
          "en": "And then once that's done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 101.92,
          "end": 104.12,
          "en": "it would be an asynchronous task, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 104.12,
          "end": 108.372,
          "en": "but once that's done, we would call setLoadedMeetups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.372,
          "end": 111.52199999999999,
          "en": "like this and set the meetups that we fetched",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 111.52199999999999,
          "end": 115.5,
          "en": "from a server has the meetups for this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.5,
          "end": 116.38,
          "en": "And for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.38,
          "end": 120.27,
          "en": "let's just simulate that we fetched the dummy meetups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.27,
          "end": 123.15,
          "en": "Of course, they are available right from the start here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 123.15,
          "end": 126.35,
          "en": "but let's assume we just fetched them from a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.35,
          "end": 130.14,
          "en": "So some promise completed here and we got back the response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.14,
          "end": 134.21,
          "en": "And now I set my dummy meetups as the loaded meetups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.21,
          "end": 138.65,
          "en": "and here in the JSX code, we passed the loaded meetups,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.65,
          "end": 141.463,
          "en": "so our state into meetup list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.47,
          "end": 144.95,
          "en": "If we do all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.95,
          "end": 148.92000000000002,
          "en": "if we visit the starting page with all the meetups,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 148.92000000000002,
          "end": 150.75,
          "en": "we don't see any difference there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 150.75,
          "end": 152.61,
          "en": "When I reload, all the meetups are there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 152.61,
          "end": 154.04,
          "en": "right from the start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.04,
          "end": 157.72,
          "en": "because we never really send a HTTP request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.72,
          "end": 160.09,
          "en": "But technically there is a difference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 160.09,
          "end": 163.24,
          "en": "because it is important to note that useEffect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 163.24,
          "end": 166.515,
          "en": "works such that it executes this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.515,
          "end": 171.515,
          "en": "after important, after the component function was executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.27,
          "end": 173.31,
          "en": "So that means that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 173.31,
          "end": 176.675,
          "en": "the first time this homepage component is rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.675,
          "end": 179.18,
          "en": "loadedMeetups will be an empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.18,
          "end": 181.526,
          "en": "Then this effect function will execute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.526,
          "end": 183.5,
          "en": "it will then update the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 183.5,
          "end": 186.48,
          "en": "and then this component function will execute again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 186.48,
          "end": 188.15,
          "en": "because the state changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 188.15,
          "end": 190.54,
          "en": "and it will then re-render the list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 190.54,
          "end": 192.72,
          "en": "with the actual data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.72,
          "end": 195.34,
          "en": "but we'll have two component renders cycles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 195.34,
          "end": 197.32,
          "en": "And in the first render cycle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.32,
          "end": 199.383,
          "en": "the first time this component renders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 199.383,
          "end": 203.13,
          "en": "loadedMeetups state will be this initial state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 203.13,
          "end": 204.403,
          "en": "this empty array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 205.34,
          "end": 207.72,
          "en": "Now, why am I emphasizing this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.72,
          "end": 210.5,
          "en": "Because if we would fetch this from a backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.5,
          "end": 212.976,
          "en": "our users might see a loading spinner briefly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 212.976,
          "end": 216.29,
          "en": "which could or could not be the user experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 216.29,
          "end": 217.88,
          "en": "we wanna offer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 217.88,
          "end": 221.36,
          "en": "But in addition, even here where we don't really",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 221.36,
          "end": 225.063,
          "en": "send the request and where the response,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 225.063,
          "end": 229.24,
          "en": "\"arrives basically, instantly\" even in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 229.24,
          "end": 231.74,
          "en": "Because of these two render cycles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.74,
          "end": 235.01,
          "en": "we have a problem with search engine optimization.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.01,
          "end": 237.094,
          "en": "If I viewed a page source, you will notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 237.094,
          "end": 241.8,
          "en": "that in there, the actual meetup data is missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 241.8,
          "end": 243.66,
          "en": "I got my unordered list here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 243.66,
          "end": 246.203,
          "en": "and this unordered list is empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 247.13,
          "end": 249.81,
          "en": "So the items which we see on the screen here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.81,
          "end": 253.74,
          "en": "these items are missing in the HTML content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 253.74,
          "end": 257.77,
          "en": "In the HTML page we fetched from the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 257.77,
          "end": 260.42,
          "en": "and they are missing because they are only rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 260.42,
          "end": 263.233,
          "en": "in the second component execution cycle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.2,
          "end": 268.23,
          "en": "But the pre-rendered HTML page generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 268.23,
          "end": 271.04,
          "en": "by NextJS automatically does not wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 271.04,
          "end": 272.9,
          "en": "for this second cycle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 272.9,
          "end": 277.3,
          "en": "It always takes the result of the first render cycle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 277.3,
          "end": 281.69,
          "en": "and return stat as the pre-rendered HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 281.69,
          "end": 284.43,
          "en": "And there, this data is missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 284.43,
          "end": 285.49,
          "en": "Now, of course, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 285.49,
          "end": 286.46,
          "en": "with the dummy data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 286.46,
          "end": 288.72,
          "en": "it's is redundant to do it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 288.72,
          "end": 291.45,
          "en": "But as I said, we are basically just simulating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 291.45,
          "end": 294.2,
          "en": "that we do fetch this data from a server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 294.2,
          "end": 298.36,
          "en": "and then we'll face the problem that NextJS does not wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 298.36,
          "end": 300.22,
          "en": "for that data to be fetched,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 300.22,
          "end": 303.26,
          "en": "to then return the fully pre-rendered page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 303.26,
          "end": 304.83,
          "en": "but it returns the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 304.83,
          "end": 307.36,
          "en": "of the first component rendered cycle.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 307.36,
          "end": 310.45,
          "en": "And that might be a pretty empty page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 310.45,
          "end": 313.43,
          "en": "And that now, was a lengthy explanation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 313.43,
          "end": 315.44,
          "en": "of the problem we're facing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 315.44,
          "end": 317.22,
          "en": "but it is an important problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 317.22,
          "end": 321.52,
          "en": "and it is important to understand this problem properly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 321.52,
          "end": 326.16,
          "en": "But thankfully, NextJS also has solutions to this problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 326.16,
          "end": 331.16,
          "en": "It has more core features built into NextJS that help us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 331.92,
          "end": 334.36,
          "en": "with precisely this problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 334.36,
          "end": 337.95,
          "en": "that we wanna pre-render a page with data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 337.95,
          "end": 341.12,
          "en": "but with data for which we have to wait.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 341.12,
          "end": 344.52,
          "en": "And we need to tell NextJS, once we're done waiting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 344.52,
          "end": 346.38,
          "en": "and therefore that's now what we're going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 346.38,
          "end": 347.49,
          "en": "to explore next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 347.49,
          "end": 350.513,
          "en": "how we can fetch data for pre-rendering.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
